          "description": "THE STRUCTURAL CLAIM OF THIS RUNG, and no row count can make it. S10 selects 125 of the 164 candidates for each of the three EXHAUST pollutant-processes and none at all for the three crankcase ones -- `pollutantprocessmodelyear` carries no 115/215/315 row, so a crankcase pollutant-process is not a rate path in this document any more than it is in MOVES. Of the 125, ONE is unrated: electricity model year 2000 (rate row 144) is selected and `emissionratebyage` has no row for it, so 124 exhaust rows emit. Of those 124, 104 carry a crankcase ratio -- the twenty electricity cohorts do not, because `crankcaseemissionratio` has no fuelTypeID 9 row and MOVES's join is an inner one. 3 x 124 + 3 x 104 = 684 emitting rate rows, and 684 x 2 day types is the 1368 the snapshot has.",
